The optional name model is not distributed with this repository.
scripts/fetch-name-model.mjs downloads Wismut/nym-pii-multilingual-small
(https://huggingface.co/Wismut/nym-pii-multilingual-small, revision
4348999cd3c2e20c49615e9af7c6bbb45b64cd85), derived from jhu-clsp/mmBERT-small,
and writes tokenizer files derived from its tokenizer.json. Its model card
declares the MIT License, whose text is reproduced above, and names no
copyright holder. The model card is downloaded beside the model as README.md.
